      "note": "荣耀 MagicOS system_server (FilteredPreloadAppManager) 与 cust_init 启动时强依赖 vendor.honor.hardware.hwfactoryinterface.IHwFactoryInterface/hwfactoryinterface_hal AIDL 服务；缺席会回退 HIDL 并在无 hwservicemanager 时抛未捕获 NoSuchElementException 导致 system_server 循环崩溃。"
    },
